==Description==
'''v2.6.0''' is the one hundred and fiftieth update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 14th of August 2026. This update is notable for adding the [[Enforcer]].

This update encompassed two versions, the main v2.6.0 update (released 14 August 2026) and the v2.6.1 (released 14 August 2026).

==Additions==
===Towers===
*[[Enforcer]]

===Units===
*[[Swat Van]]
*[[Swat Van Gunner]]

==Changes & Bugfixes==
*[[Shotgunner]] nerfed in regular modes.
**Statistical changes:
***'''Base'''
****Cost increased from {{Money|1,225}} to {{Money|1,500}}.
****Firerate decreased from 1.2 to 1.1.
****Spread decreased from 10 to 5. 
***'''Level 1'''
****Cost increased from {{Money|640}} to {{Money|750}}.
***'''Level 2'''
****Cost decreased from {{Money|1,550}} to {{Money|1,500}}.
****Pellets changed from {{Tooltip|8 > 10|+2}} to {{Tooltip|8 > 9|+1}}.
****Spread changed from {{Tooltip|10 > 15|+5}} to {{Tooltip|5 > 10|+5}}.
****Firerate changed from {{Tooltip|1.2 > 0.85|-0.35}} to {{Tooltip|1.1 > 0.8|-0.3}}.
***'''Level 3'''
****Cost decreased from {{Money|6,500}} to {{Money|6,000}}.
***'''Level 4'''
****Cost increased from {{Money|18,500}} to {{Money|18,777}}.
****Firerate changed from {{Tooltip|0.85 > 0.75|-0.1}} to 0.8.
*[[Juggernaut]] rebalanced.
**Statistical changes:
***'''Base'''
****Cost increased from {{Money|8,000}} to {{Money|10,000}}.
****Damage increased from 9 to 10.
****Firerate decreased from 0.15 to 0.14.
***'''Level 1'''
****Cost decreased from {{Money|3,000}} to {{Money|2,800}}.
****Firerate changed from {{Tooltip|0.15 > 0.12|-0.03}} to {{Tooltip|0.14 > 0.12|-0.02}}.
***'''Level 3'''
****Damage increased from +14 to +15.
***'''Level 4A'''
****Cost decreased from {{Money|45,000}} to {{Money|35,000}}.
****Damage decreased from +37 to +35.
****Fortify radius increased from 10 to 13.
****Fortify debuff time reduction increased from 25% to 35%.
***'''Level 5A'''
****Cost increased from {{Money|55,000}} to {{Money|60,000}}.
****Damage increased from +35 to +55.
****Firerate changed from {{Tooltip|0.225 > 0.2|-0.025}} to 0.15.
****Fortify radius decreased from +3 to +1.
****Fortify debuff time reduction increased from 25% to 35% > 40%.
***'''Level 6A'''
****Cost decreased from {{Money|100,000}} to {{Money|95,000}}.
****Fortify debuff time reduction increased from 25% > 30% to 40%.
***'''Level 7A'''
****Fortify radius increased from +1 to +2.
****Fortify debuff time reduction changed from 30% > 50% to 40% > 50%.
***'''Level 4B'''
****Damage decreased from +12 to +10.
***'''Level 6B'''
****Cost increased from {{Money|120,000}} to {{Money|130,000}}.
****Damage increased from +50 to +55.
****Range decreased from +2 to +0.
***'''Level 7B'''
****Cost decreased from {{Money|250,000}} to {{Money|230,000}}.
****Boss multiplier changed from 1.4 to 1.4 > 1.5.
*[[Medic]] rebalanced.
**Statistical changes:
***'''Level 3'''
****Cost decreased from {{Money|2,950}} to {{Money|2,400}}.
****''Ubercharge'' duration decreased from 10 to 7.5.
****Overheal limit increased from -90 to +90.
***'''Level 4'''
****Cost decreased from {{Money|6,000}} to {{Money|5,000}}.
****''Ubercharge'' duration changed from 10 > 12.5 to 7.5 > 10.
****Overheal limit decreased from +90 to +0.
***'''Level 5'''
****Cost decreased from {{Money|14,000}} to {{Money|12,000}}.
****''Ubercharge'' duration changed from 12.5 > 15 to 10.
*[[Kingpin]] rebalanced.
**Statistical changes:
***'''Level 4A'''
****Reward percentage increased from 50% to 60%.
****''Bounty'' cooldown decreased from 150 to 120.
****''Bounty'' initial cooldown of 40 added.
***'''Level 5A'''
****Reward percentage increased from 50% > 70% to 60% > 80%.
***'''Level 6A'''
****Reward percentage increased from 70% > 100% to 80% > 100%.
****Reward cap changed from {{Money|25,000}} > {{Money|60,000}} to {{Money|25,000}} > {{Money|50,000}}.
***'''Level 4B'''
****[[Bouncer]] health decreased from 550 to 500.
***'''Level 5B'''
****[[Bouncer]] health increased from +200 to +250.
***'''Level 6B'''
****[[Contractor]] changed.
****Health increased from 200 to 400.
****Damage increased from 165 to 170.
****Lifespan increased from 70 to 75.
***[[Lackey]] changed.
****Damage decreased from +2 to +1.
****Range decreased from +2.5 to +0.5.
*[[Void Reaver]]'s ''Void Rupture'' unit damage decreased from 100,000 to 1,500.
*[[Golden Mystery]] changed.
**Now spawns the [[Korblox Deathwalker (The Hunt: Mega Edition)|Korblox Deathwalker]], [[Conserver]], [[Corrupted Conserver (Nil Zone)|Corrupted Conserver]], [[Nuclear Monster]], [[Kronus]], [[Null Commander]], [[Frost Spirit]], [[Producer]], [[Narrator (Enemy)|Narrator]], [[Titus]], [[Corrupted Titus]], [[Null Guardian]], [[Brute]], [[Patient Zero]], [[Corrupted Haz3mn]], [[Fallen King]], [[Wox the Fox]], [[Nerd Ducky]], [[Ducky D00M III]], [[Molten Warlord]], [[Executioner (Pizza Party)|Executioner]], [[Jack-o-Bot]], [[Mechanical Rot (Nil Zone)|Mechanical Rot]] and [[Gunslinger]] instead of every single modern enemy in alphabetical order.
**[[Stun Immunity]] added.
**[[Freeze Immunity]] added.
*Added a penalty for the [[Enforcer]] generating fireworks by making it divide the [[Firework Buff]] chance by 7.
*Added a button in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode that returns the player to the [[Main Lobby]].

:In '''v2.6.1''':
*Fixed [[Enforcer]] calculating DPS without accounting for pellets, pump time or reload time.
*Fixed [[Hacker]] being unable to clone towers of other players.
*Fixed UI sometimes not loading or corrupting in mobile.

